# API & Service

## Routes

- Unified prefix `/v1/`; handlers under `internal/api/`
- Table-scoped routes: `/v1/tables/{tableId}/...` (`tableId` = logical table name)
- Action suffixes: `POST ...:rename`, `POST ...:query`, `POST ...:bulkUpsert`
- JSON is camelCase; column cells use the `shared.Value` union

## Service layering

```
handler → LowcodeService method → MetaPool / DataPool
```

- Meta queries: `s.tenants.MetaPool()` — lc_tables, lc_columns, lc_queries, etc.
- Data DDL/DML: `s.tenants.DataPool(ctx)` — CREATE TABLE, ALTER, row CRUD, INDEX
- Tenant: `tenantID(ctx)` from `X-Tenant-Id`

## Column types

- Physical column name equals logical `name`; `ColumnPgColumnByRef` resolves the logical name
- Physical columns: `AddColumn` runs `ALTER TABLE ... ADD COLUMN` (`typeId` must be a built-in `internal/columntype` type or a columnType DOMAIN)
- Virtual columns (`formula` / `link` / `lookup` / `rollup`): write `lc_columns` only; no matching data-DB column; expanded in SQL at query time
- Value type: `config.result_type_id` → API `resultTypeId` (lookup inferred; formula/rollup inferred or overridden)

## Index operations

- Routes: `GET/POST /v1/indexes`, `GET/DELETE /v1/indexes/{pgIndexName}`
- List: `GET /v1/indexes?table_id=xxx` → `listPGIndexes` → `pgIndexesToAPI`
- Create: `CREATE INDEX` on data DB; name `idx_{table}_{logicalName}`
- Delete: `DROP INDEX`; `Id` = PG index name

## Column operations

- Routes: `GET/POST /v1/columns`, `PATCH/DELETE /v1/columns/{id}`
- List: `GET /v1/columns?table_id=xxx` → `ListColumns`
- Create: `POST /v1/columns` (body includes `tableId`) → `AddColumn`
- Update/delete: by column resource `id`

## Query

- `QueryRows` / `ExecuteQuery` → `executeQuery`
- Filter: `dsl.Parse` + `query.BuildWhere`
- Saved Query column projection + filter attributes may be outside the SELECT list; attrMap must include all physical columns

## Tests

- Pure logic: `internal/dsl`, `internal/query`
- Integration: `integration_test.go` + `testutil.SetupIntegration` (skip without DB)
- When changing handlers, update `handler_test.go`
